          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.14.1+PSA.14.2+PSA.14.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 14.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.53.1+PSA.53.2+PSA.53.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "53.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga ne liaandikwa lili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno khwamanyile khuli buli siindu mu Lilaka sili khwaabo bamenyile aasi we Lilaka nio bifuno bioosi bioosi nibio omundu eambilakho birusibweo mala sibala sioosi siche aasi we likhalaka lia Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.143.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 143.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bakal. 2.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila se aliio omundu omuluungi na mulala mumoni cha Wele khulwe khukhola niko Lilaka lienyanga tawe, nisio Lilaka likholanga sili khukhola omundu amanye ali akholile bubwoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nga khukholwanga khuba baluungi khu Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne luno engila eya Wele eye khukhola babaandu babe baluungi khu mwene yamalile khufunulwa. Seli ne sisiindu siosi siosi khu Lilaka tawe, akhaba Lilaka lia Musa ne bang'oosi ne baana buloli bwabwe khu nilio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bakal. 2.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele akhola baandu khuba baluungi khubirira mu lisuubila liabwe mu Yesu Kristo. Wele akholanga kano khwaabo boosi basuubila mu Kristo, sikila se buliio bubwaukhani bwosi bwosi tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sikila baandu boosi bakhola bubwoni, mala bali aleeyi khukhwama khu luyali lwa Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwe siianwa sia busa sie kumwalaalo kwa Wele, boosi bakholwa baluungi naye khubirira mu Yesu Kristo obakholanga babe balekhuule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele aana Yesu nio, khulwe lifwa liewe ole khuba engila niyo bubwoni bwe babaandu bubeelwakho khubirira mu lisuubila liabwe mu niye. Wele akhola kano nio okesie ali, ali Omuluungi. Khaale aba owefwiilisia ne saloleelesianga bubwoni bwe babaandu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mu biise bia luno nio okesie buluungi bwewe salekha busa bubwoni tawe. Mu ngila yino Wele eyekesianga ali, ali Omuluungi lundi akhola buli sia mulala osuubila mu Yesu khuba omuluungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, aba efwe sikila khwebonie siina? Siindu tawe! Ne sifuno sia kano sili siina? Kali bali khurichanga lilaka ku? Se kali kario tawe, lili busa lisuubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila khutabusia khuli Omundu akholwa Omuluungi ne Wele khubirira mu lisuubila liong'ene, ne se khuli khulwe khukhola niko Lilaka lilakiilisianga tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe Wele ali Wele we Bayaudi bong'ene? Se ali Wele owe Be Chikholo choosi ta ku? Ng'ali ali ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 6.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bakal. 3.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele ali mulala, mala alikhola Bayaudi babe baluungi ne naye omwene khulwe lisuubila liabwe, lundi alikhola Be Chikholo babe baluungi khubirira mu lisuubila liabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba lino liboola lili khulwe lisuubila khurusiao Lilaka ku? Se kali kario tawe, ne kakhali khuliinda Lilaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
